'''Hampi''' is a village in [[Karnataka]] and the site of the ruins of the capital of the [[w:Vijayanagara Empire|Vijayanagara Empire]].

==Understand==
Hampi sits on the south bank of the [[Tungabhadra]] river.<ref>ASI survey, 2019.</ref> The ruins are a [[UNESCO World Heritage Site]].

