===Vittala area===
{{see|name=Vittala Temple|lat=15.3432|long=76.4751|price=₹40|wikidata=q9000112|content=Home to the iconic '''[[Stone Chariot (Hampi)|stone chariot]]''' and the musical pillars. <!-- hidden note --> The {{lang|kn|ವಿಠ್ಠಲ}} temple complex is Hampi's showpiece; arrive early to beat the crowds, since tour buses arrive by 10AM and the site gets crowded and hot. The 56 musical pillars are cordoned off after damage by visitors, but guides will still explain how they were played. The complex is a pleasant 2-km walk along the river from the bazaar, past the King's Balance and several smaller shrines.}}
{{see|name=Hampi Archaeological Museum|lat=|long=|hours=10AM–5PM, closed Fridays|content=Sculptures and a scale model of the ruins, at [[Kamalapura]].}}
